  "text": "For **men in India under ₹2,000**, the safest brand picks are **Wrangler**, **Lee**, **Levi’s on sale**, **Spykar on discount**, and **Numero Uno**; among these, **Wrangler** is the strongest all-around value pick because it is repeatedly listed in budget-jeans recommendations and has multiple styles available under ₹2,000.[3][9][20]\n\nIf you want a quick choice by priority:\n\n- **Best overall value:** **Wrangler**[3][9][20]\n- **Best if you want a premium brand on discount:** **Levi’s**[2][3][12]\n- **Best budget-friendly Indian option:** **Numero Uno**[5][3]\n- **Good sale option:** **Spykar**[3][13]\n- **Good mass-market alternative:** **Lee**[3][17]\n\nA practical buying rule: if your budget is capped at ₹2,000, choose the brand that has the **best fit for your body type** rather than the most famous logo, because fit and comfort matter more than brand at this price point.[1][10][17]\n\nIf you want, I can also give you:\n- the **best brand by fit** for slim/regular/loose body type, or\n- a **top 5 jeans list under ₹2,000 with current options in India**.",
